  "notes": "The Sequencer steps once per beat of its own clock, so **Tempo** at 256 BPM plays eighth notes at 128. Steps 2 and 7 rest. Turn the filter's **Cutoff** and **Envelope Amount** while it runs; **Resonance** past about 0.95 starts to whistle."
